    {
      "text": "Letter of Justification: the site is the former Mirassou Elementary School, owned by Union School District, declared surplus in 1980 and closed in 1989. The northern 4.8 acres are leased to Stratford Elementary and Bright Horizons Preschool. Lots exceed 10,000 sq ft and average over 11,750 sq ft. Robson Homes proposes a $350,000 contribution toward a traffic signal at Belgatos Road and Blossom Hill Road.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-004000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A public comment exhibit in a Town of Los Gatos meeting packet reproduces a Union School District account: the district issued an RFQ/P for the approximately 4.28-acre Mirassou A field area, received three proposals by January 12, 2024, selected Robson Homes (proposal of 12 homes), and approved an Exchange Agreement and Joint Escrow Instructions with Robson Homes, LLC at an exchange value of $12,722,100.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-004002"
      ]
    }
